Skip usage_vs_refs.sh: it cross-checks every option printed by --help against
references in GNU's doc/coreutils.texi. That manual is not part of this
implementation, so the test can only ever report our own options (-V, uptime
--pretty, hostname --fqdn, ...) as undocumented.

